Package: popp-client
Version: [[version]]
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-headless | java21-runtime-headless, adduser
Maintainer: Service Health erx GmbH <info@service-health.de>
Homepage: https://www.service-health.de/
Description: gematik POPP client example application
 Spring Boot service that drives a Konnektor to produce PoPP tokens for
 electronic health cards. Serves HTTP on port 8081 and, when CETP is
 enabled, listens for card events from the Konnektor on port 8585.
 .
 All settings are read from the environment file /etc/default/popp-client.
